<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mike-li-mingzhe" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6255098); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6255098&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605945762" alt="Mike li mingzhe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6255098)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mike-li-mingzhe" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6255098); return false;">Mike li mingzhe</a></span></p>
