</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00185/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一辆与██品牌共享单车无异的共享单车，其异常性质在于车辆标牌无法被电子设备识别，且无涂抹痕迹。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>吉林省██市██路██商场门口<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>就近收容于Site-CN-05低价值物品收容区<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>成像非常清晰，但就是识别不上，气得半死。一一研究员Miku ████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00185" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00185" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00185-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku-maekawa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3522164); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3522164&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605945762" alt="Miku Maekawa" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3522164)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku-maekawa" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3522164); return false;">Miku Maekawa</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589269677 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 May 2020 07:47</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00222/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张10m的裹尸布。当项目与一处于醉酒状态的人类个体处在一个单独的空间内时，项目将会瞬移至对象的身边，并完全包裹住对象的身体。期间对象能够正常呼吸但报告称感受到持续的“窒息感”。在异常效应显现十分钟后对象将会直接死亡，经鉴定死亡原因为窒息而死。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>████/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>████<br />
<strong>目前状态：</strong>Site-CN-75的标准异常物品收容柜内。</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00222" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00222" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00222-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yoghurt-rescuer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3167340); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3167340&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605945762" alt="Yoghurt-rescuer" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3167340)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yoghurt-rescuer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3167340); return false;">Yoghurt-rescuer</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590679306 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 15:21</span></p>
</div>
